sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EnergyTransferSuspended

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = EVCommunicationLost, transactionInfo.chargingState = Idle, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector
    alt Message: StatusNotificationRequest
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available, evseId = <Configured evseId>, connectorId = <Configured connectorId>)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else Message: NotifyEventRequest
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", component.evse.id = <Configured evseId>, component.evse.connectorId = <Configured connectorId>, variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = CablePluggedIn, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging, eventType = Updated)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
